> References

- [Movshovitz-Attias et al. (2017), No Fuss Distance Metric Learning Using Proxies](https://arxiv.org/abs/1703.07464).
- [Kim et al. (2020), Proxy Anchor Loss for Deep Metric Learning](https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.13911).
